ng data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"266\">DeepCool PK750D 750 Watt 80 PLUS Bronze Certified Non-Modular Power Supply</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"533\" style=\"text-align: justify; \">Upgrade your system’s power with the <strong data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"342\">DeepCool PK750D 750W <a href=\"/component/power-supply\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Power Supply</a></strong>, designed to deliver stable and efficient performance for modern PCs. With <strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"450\">80 PLUS Bronze certification</strong>, it ensures up to <strong data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"494\">85% energy efficiency</strong>, reducing excess heat and power waste.</p>\n<p data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"810\" style=\"text-align: justify; \">The DeepCool PK750D 750 W 80 PLUS Bronze Power Supply is a robust and efficient non-modular unit designed to power modern mid- to high-range desktop builds. Certified 80 PLUS Bronze, it delivers up to 85% efficiency at typical load, reducing waste heat and saving energy. Its active PFC and DC-to-DC conversion topology ensures stable output across the +3.3V and +5V rails, which improves compatibility with contemporary hardware. The 120 mm Hypro-bearing fan offers reliable and quiet cooling, while the PSU’s durable construction includes Taiwan-made capacitors and a comprehensive protection suite (OVP, OCP, SCP, OPP, UVP, and OTP) to safeguard your system. Built to function in ambient temperatures up to 40 °C and altitudes up to 5,000 m, the PK750D supports demanding operating environments. With a 5-year warranty and a compact 150 × 140 × 86 mm form factor, this PSU offers dependable performance and long-term value for gaming rigs, content creation desktops, or other power-hungry builds.</p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br></div>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"DeepCool 